le you use it or you  lose it today it's a great regret to be  that the arts music literature poetry  the seen as not being really necessary  because at times of life you need to  have in your mind something that you can  draw on something that you can refer to  something that will fill out your life  so many people are suffering from mental  illness from strain from stress from  having so much pressure faced off or  forced on them somehow we need today  more than ever this ability to be at  peace with ourselves within  I'm not sure whether ever one really  reaches a state of complete happiness  it's an elusive term really I suppose  all I can strive for is to have a  greater degree of inner contentment  which is in the fact part of the road  towards happiness
 

